      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my doctor just put me on atorvastatin for my cholesterol but i also drink a lot of grapefruit juice in the mornings like a smoothie habit. is that gonna be an issue or can i just keep doing my thing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
